{"about_the_game":"Back Rank Chess is a brand new chess variant.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is very easy to learn.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou must protect the back rank against an onslaught of enemy pawns. <br />\r\nThe pawns are controlled by an advanced chess engine that will outsmart you many times!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou win by capturing all the enemy pawns before they reach the back rank. <br />\r\nIf any pawn touches the back rank, you lose.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features THREE modes of difficulty - BEGINNER, AMATEUR and EXPERT.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 66 hand-crafted stages, each titled and designed for a unique experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWatch out - the Expert stages might kick your butt !","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2275650?t=1706972579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1706972579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1706972579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1706972579","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Back Rank Chess is a brand new chess variant.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is very easy to learn.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou must protect the back rank against an onslaught of enemy pawns. <br />\r\nThe pawns are controlled by an advanced chess engine that will outsmart you many times!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou win by capturing all the enemy pawns before they reach the back rank. <br />\r\nIf any pawn touches the back rank, you lose.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features THREE modes of difficulty - BEGINNER, AMATEUR and EXPERT.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 66 hand-crafted stages, each titled and designed for a unique experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nW